SCOPE AND IMPORTANT EXCEPTIONS
------------------------------

1. This MIT license covers ONLY the WSTU repository artifacts: the processing
   scripts, the registry/metadata files, and the documentation authored here.

2. It does NOT cover any upstream dataset content. Every source dataset keeps its
   own license, and the upstream dataset card and license file remain the sole
   authoritative source for that content. Source licenses are recorded per record
   in metadata/dataset_registry.json ("license", "license_class", "license_url")
   and summarized in docs/LICENSES.md and metadata/license_stats.json.

3. Redistribution of the built corpus (data/*.jsonl) must satisfy the terms of
   EVERY included source dataset simultaneously, including attribution,
   share-alike and no-derivatives constraints. Datasets marked
   license_class = "noncommercial", "no_derivatives" or "unknown" are kept out of
   the training pool (status = legal_review) precisely because their terms are not
   confirmed to permit this use.

4. No dataset is included merely because it is publicly downloadable. Publicly
   downloadable is not the same as commercially reusable or redistribution-safe.